-- Blackfathom Deeps (map 48): the plan for the run leader (.bot run), exported from turtle-agent abd37a3
-- (dungeons/blackfathom_deeps.json, status 'draft (not mapped, not live-checked)') with the options of the header of 20261017130000:
--   turtle-agent plan-export --mmaps <map 48 mmaps> --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --approach-hops --rev abd37a3 \
--     --stamp 20261022210700 --out <dir> blackfathom_deeps
-- Stacks on 20261022210000. NO ROW IS HAND-SET. 7 legs, 580 steps, 588 rows (46 + 9 + 51 + 14 + 18 + 29 + 3 pulls; bosses 4887 Ghamoo-ra,
-- 4831 Lady Sarevess, 6243 Gelihast, 62530 Velthelaxx the Defiler, 4830 Old Serra'kis, 4832 Twilight Lord Kelris, 4829 Aku'mai, in leg order).
-- Plan check (turtle-agent plan-check, map 48 mmaps): 1 of 241 points fails: leg 4 (old_serra'kis) boss look -746.7 -169.4 -50.6 needs a mapping
-- walk (the plan marks it needs_walk). 152 run-leader-hop warnings (a pull or boss 50-320 yd from the move row before it; the run leader walks
-- there in navmesh hops of its own) and 9 detour warnings (a pack 25-42 yd away whose way is 108-378 yd: the tank finds no firing position; stand
-- the party on the pack's own layer): leg 2 pull groups 3 and 6, leg 4 pull groups 8 and 11, leg 5 pull groups 12, 16, 19, 20 and 22 (1-based,
-- as plan-check prints them). The draft has no door, event, shrine, gossip or item step: the shrine event, the portal door and the Fathom Stone are
-- in the world data, not in the plan.
--
-- WHAT THE RUN LEADER CANNOT DO (issue #984: nothing is dropped silently). Not in these rows:
--   * the plan's unit lists (cc_priority, cc_always, kill_first, fleers) are empty in this export; the census of PREP-BFD-DS-2026-10-22.md fills
--     them in the fix round, in the plan row's three columns (the exporter has no column for fleers and warns).
--   * the entrance (trigger 257, the portal at 4252.37 756.974 -23.0632 on map 1), level_band 22-27 and hire_composition: the run leader starts
--     inside the instance and leads the bound party as it is.
--   * the patrols (creature_movement paths of 21 spawns, the bosses Lady Sarevess 4831, Old Serra'kis 4830 and Aku'mai 4829 among them): no
--     column; the first live run is the mapping walk the plan notes ask for.
--   * a mapping walk: leg 4's boss point is not snapped to the navmesh (needs_walk) and no stand, door or z/LOS judgement of the draft has been
--     walked in game.
--
-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- blackfathom_deeps: map 48, 7 legs, 580 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'blackfathom_deeps';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'blackfathom_deeps';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'blackfathom_deeps';

-- Dungeon bosses of map 48, for the commander telemetry's boss rank (see 20261021114931_world.sql): the seven boss steps' entries,
-- read from Turtle's own world data (tortoise-wow sql/base creature_template: all seven are rank 1 there, so the telemetry would call
-- them 'e'). Baron Aquanis 12876 (summoned at the Fathom Stone, no spawn row) and the friendly Argent Guard Thaelrid 4787 are not
-- bosses of a plan step and are left out. A DELETE of this one map, then REPLACE.
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_boss` WHERE `map` IN (48);
